  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community Participatory Integrated WASH Improvement Project in Zomba District, Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen the capacity of the Water Point Committee and conduct monitoring. Support community-led sanitation and hygiene improvement activities and the establishment of an integrated sanitation ecosystem. Provide hygiene behavior improvement education and campaigns for the local community and the caregivers of children under five. Strengthen governance to establish a community-based WASH monitoring system and provide devices and training for the WASH data management using ICT.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to the reduction of waterborne diseases in Zomba District through the Community Participatory Integrated WASH Improvement Project.&#xAC1C;&#xC120;&#xB41C; &#xD654;&#xC7A5;&#xC2E4; &#xC774;&#xC6A9; &#xC778;&#xAD6C;&#xC218;, &#xC190;&#xC53B;&#xAE30; &#xC2DC;&#xC124; &#xBCF4;&#xC720; &#xC778;&#xAD6C;&#xC218;, &#xB178;&#xC0C1;&#xBC30;&#xBCC0; &#xADFC;&#xC808; &#xB2EC;&#xC131; &#xB9C8;&#xC744; &#xC218;</narrative>
  </description>
